{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【ACGHK 2026】「ElefunPop(潮巨匠)」攤位報導！世界頂尖藝術家齊聚一堂</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0c396aaaea3bc5046d206e72673dab31da55aa02d2cf5121ac2b30c1acccbad7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1f7a3e3eb7d9a2bb9c7bb567021955f3.jpg\"/><p>於2026年7月24日(五)至7月28日(二)舉辦的「 ACGHK 2026 」－「Ani-Com &amp; Games Hong Kong 2026( 香港動漫電玩節 2026)」 本次為大家帶來「 ElefunPop (潮巨匠)」的攤位報導！</p><h3>為您介紹展示世界頂尖藝術家限定公仔的「ElefunPop」攤位！</h3><p>ElefunPop攤位</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/474d4f6ee557ab429612d5fc737fff46bfb0d794fc0f8b3426f73e67f93e4783/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7c632ec5e40148405e4789e7ae19b4c2.jpg\"/><p>匯集來自世界各國頂尖藝術家的原創藝術玩具及限定公仔，大量展示與販售的「ElefunPop(潮巨匠)」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/be3f315a4c06efd590ca4b7632111b9047700c86c5513e86efb4658604444881/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1ec41c67d39218022fb3390b57072b23.jpg\"/><p>攤位吸引了大量粉絲，熱鬧非凡！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e477a3d0b974af06921474f2dd4b913a416d1df5b5d3858f22604b18abba468b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7e6d591afd1c80c8934dcaa82a64f483.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2b2c6a24cd2e1120e0a1ebac565c216aa43ea2ed4c1cd67f0fa3329b1c8e799a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc779fa78d7f94b3c8e69ac9c2e121b48.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8acbbb4b24a3c5f92acd0dc08128ca6e33d051ebaa24267b91c71d11641cc5f4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F57b480c6e1552db84c38741c6d7495e5.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mys