.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/905a42eac300ea20dc86d5996341ac490c68a78d03dc2105f1368d705b145fb1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5504c8b7b86e7574449b530fd8e32a2f.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/0ffb8e3596d7ed63909da9aee1a1e303f880735cc54341b8cf9b7ff2524fdc46/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7dc95f95447d89611dccb1f233840bc8.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e1ad73d6ccc9ffcbc2b900733a7546fdd81ac756dcc93fdc01aac86afe1f93c6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F48d4f2ee7f273eefee7f4e869d640f37.jpg\"/><p>展示著多種風格的作品，蘊含深意的獨特命名也令人印象深刻。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/bcc9e2bf9d68876500b3ed067afb6287c00a6082ec55bd69abe93fe481a44800/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F334e581a0ef7aee2cb675e3be02bd4e9.jpg\"/><p>以上是充滿個性的藝術玩具令來場者為之著迷的「ElefunPop」攤位報導！</p><p>🔸【ACGHK 2026】「白銀之城」展位報導！可盡情沉浸於世界觀的拍照打卡點與試玩區等 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「日清 Toy Cube」「日清 VOCALOID」攤位報導！重新設計的清仔、人氣 Piapro Characters 等精彩內容 🔸直擊【ACGHK 2026】「Inno Models」「threezero」攤位直擊！現場展示了不知火舞及高智能方程式主題模型車 🔸【ACGHK 2026】「香港世界同人祭」報導！以鷹取屋先生為首，涵蓋世界各地美食特輯、賽馬娘以及VTuberr等各類主題的全方位同人祭 🔸【ACGHK 2026】不輸 Comic Market！香港舉辦的 ACGHK 2026 Cosplay 同人攤位報導！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T10:55:15.970521+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":762,"images":32,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}